    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 29,
    "summary": "All Israel makes a liberal offering for the temple—David blesses and praises the Lord and instructs the people—David dies—Solomon reigns as king—The books of Nathan and Gad are mentioned.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
